{"speciesId":625,"names":{"fr":"Scalproie","es":"Bisharp","en":"Bisharp","ja":"キリキザン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils dirigent les groupes de Scalpion. Ils se battent pour la suprématie sur le groupe, et les perdants en sont exclus."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It leads a group of Pawniard. It battles to become the boss, but will be driven from the group if it loses."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il chasse avec un groupe de Scalpion sous ses ordres, mais c’est lui qui donne le coup de grâce."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Bisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon sans pitié qui tranche en deux ses proies immobilisées par les cohortes de Scalpion qu’il commande."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon temible que remata a su presa una vez que su séquito de Pawniard la ha debilitado e inmovilizado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"数匹の コマタナを 戦わせ 傷つき 動けなくなった 獲物を 真っ二つにする 怖い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il chasse avec un groupe de Scalpion sous ses ordres, mais c’est lui qui donne le coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su séquito son los Pawniard. Acorralan a su presa con todo el grupo y Bisharp propina el golpe de gracia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Bisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大勢の コマタナを 従えて 獲物を 群れで 追いつめる。 とどめは キリキザンが 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon sans pitié qui tranche en deux ses proies immobilisées par les cohortes de Scalpion qu’il commande."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon temible que remata a su presa una vez que su séquito de Pawniard la ha debilitado e inmovilizado."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"数匹の コマタナを 戦わせ 傷つき 動けなくなった 獲物を 真っ二つにする 怖い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il chasse avec un groupe de Scalpion sous ses ordres, mais c’est lui qui donne le coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Su séquito son los Pawniard. Acorralan a su presa con todo el grupo y Bisharp propina el golpe de gracia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Bisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大勢の コマタナを 従えて 獲物を 群れで 追いつめる。 とどめは キリキザンが 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Peu importe la puissance du Scalproie, il abdique de son rôle de chef si la lame de sa tête subit la moindre ébréchure."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Por fuerte que sea un Bisharp, la más mínima mella en la hoja de su cabeza es deshonrosa y motivo de destitución como líder de su grupo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"No matter how strong the Bisharp, it’s said that if the blade on its head is chipped, it will retire from its position as the boss."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"どんなに 強い キリキザンでも 頭の 刃が 刃こぼれすると ボスの 座を 引退すると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il dirige une cohorte de Scalpion. Il ne laisse transparaître aucune émotion lorsqu’il assène le coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lidera un grupo de Pawniard y no muestra el más mínimo sentimiento ni cuando propina el ataque de gracia al rival."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It leads a group of Pawniard. Bisharp doesn’t even change its expression when it deals the finishing blow to an opponent."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"コマタナの 群れを 率いている。 相手に 止めを 刺すときも 一切 表情を 変えない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il dirige des cohortes de Scalpion. Il garde constamment ses sous-fifres à l’œil pour parer à toute velléité de mutinerie."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Siempre va acompañado por un nutrido séquito de Pawniard, a los que no pierde nunca de vista para evitar posibles motines."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s accompanied by a large retinue of Pawniard. Bisharp keeps a keen eye on its minions, ensuring none of them even think of double-crossing it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大勢の コマタナを 従える。 手下たちが 裏切らない よう 常に 目を 光らせている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa recherche des meilleurs endroits où trouver des pierres pour affûter ses lames le conduit souvent à affronter des Incisache."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Libra encarnizados combates con los Fraxure por el control de los emplazamientos donde se hallan las piedras con las que afila sus cuchillas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Violent conflicts erupt between Bisharp and Fraxure over places where sharpening stones can be found."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"刃を 研ぐ 石が ある 場所を めぐって オノンドと 激しい 争いを 繰りひろげる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":625,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"guillotine","learns":[[11,"level-up",71],[14,"level-up",71],[15,"level-